  <p id="c-nanshi-048-lugao-ancestry:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-048-lugao-ancestry:p001:m0000" ref="t6x_0wm_0k5_AA">陸杲</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-048-lugao-ancestry:p001:m0003" ref="t6x_0wm_0k5_AA">明霞</persName>，吳郡吳人也。祖<persName id="c-nanshi-048-lugao-ancestry:p001:m0013" ref="t6x_0wm_0k5">徽</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-048-lugao-ancestry:p001:m0015" ref="t6x_0wm_0k5">休猷</persName>，宋補建康令，清平無私，為文帝所善。元嘉十五年，除平越中郎將、廣州刺史，加督，清名亞<persName id="c-nanshi-048-lugao-ancestry:p001:m0059" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDACAA">王鎮之</persName>，為士庶所愛詠。二十三年，為益州刺史，亦加督，恤隱有方，威惠兼著，寇盜靜息，人物殷阜，蜀土安之。卒於官，身亡之日，家無餘財，文帝甚痛惜之，諡曰簡子。父<persName id="c-nanshi-048-lugao-ancestry:p001:m0137" ref="t6x_0wm_0k5_A">叡</persName>，揚州中從事。</p>
</text>
